exports[`partnerAlertEmail > lists what people with a link changed, links the MAP and offers its own unsubscribe 1`] = `
"PartnerStandard Desk

Here’s what changed in your MAP with Brightwave:

• Lena Ortiz marked “Register first deal” done

• Lena Ortiz updated “Close 3 deals”

Open the MAP https://map.test/plans/map_0123456789

----------------------------------------

You get these alerts because you own this MAP. Change how often under Notifications on the MAP.

Unsubscribe from partner activity alerts https://map.test/n/u/unsub.sig"
`;

